The analysed firmware is Rapt's property and is not distributed here: nothing in
this repository is a copy of it. `extract/certs/` holds public root certificates
found in the image's CA bundle, `extract/api/` holds responses captured from a pill
we own, and everything under `notes/` is our own observation. The web assets
`scripts/extract_assets.py` carves are Rapt's, stay gitignored, and are not
published.
